---
layout: base.njk
bodyClass: site doc-page
extraCss: [home.css]
permalink: en/index.html
title: "Mouton — Notes on philosophy, the body, food and work"
description: "The English edition of Mouton, a personal archive. Essays on philosophy and how to live, the body, food and science, and work, checked against research and data."
---
{% include "partials/nav-en.njk" %}
<script>try{if(localStorage.getItem('mouton.cover')==='day')document.documentElement.dataset.cover='day'}catch(e){}</script>
<section class="cover cover-en" id="top" data-nav="dark" data-nav-solid="dark">
  <div class="cover-art" aria-hidden="true"><i class="cover-light l1"></i><i class="cover-light l2"></i><i class="cover-light l3"></i></div>
  <div class="cover-inner">
    <p class="cover-kicker">A late-night club for questions</p>
    <p class="cover-title" lang="en">Philosophy and science, for seeing everyday life differently.</p>
    <p class="cover-lede">Appearance, money and how to live, checked against research. Answer a true-or-false question, then read.</p>
    <div class="cover-actions">
      <a class="cover-btn is-primary" href="#journal">Read the essays</a>
      <a class="cover-btn" href="quiz.html">Take the quiz</a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <button class="cover-mode" type="button" data-cover-toggle aria-pressed="false"><span class="cover-mode-day">Day</span><span class="cover-mode-night">Night</span></button>
</section>
<main class="doc topic" data-nav="light" data-nav-solid="light">
  <p class="eyebrow">English edition</p>
  <h1 class="doc-title">Mouton</h1>
  <p>A personal archive. I try things I'm curious about, make things, and keep a record of the process. I write about philosophy and how to live, the body, food, and work, checking papers and data along the way.</p>
  <p>These essays were first written in Japanese. Product recommendations in the original articles point to Japanese shops, so the English edition describes what to look for without shop links. <a href="../index.html" hreflang="ja" lang="ja">日本語版はこちら</a></p>
  <p><a class="btn btn-dark" href="guides.html">Buying guides <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a> <a class="btn btn-dark" href="quiz.html">10-question quiz <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></p>
  <section class="quiz-more doc-quiz" aria-labelledby="doc-quiz-heading"><p class="quiz-more-title" id="doc-quiz-heading">Try one <span>True or false</span></p>
  <div class="qloop" data-qloop></div></section>
  <section id="journal" aria-labelledby="journal-heading">
    <h2 id="journal-heading" class="eyebrow">Journal — {{ collections.articlesEn.length }} {{ "article" if collections.articlesEn.length == 1 else "articles" }}</h2>
    {%- for t in topics %}
    {%- set list = collections.articlesEn | inTopic(t.key) %}
    <section id="{{ t.key }}" aria-labelledby="topic-{{ t.key }}">
      <h2 class="doc-title" id="topic-{{ t.key }}">{{ t.en }}</h2>
      <div class="topic-list">
        {%- for a in list %}
        <a class="topic-item" data-rise href="{{ a.page.fileSlug }}.html">
          <span class="topic-date">{{ a.page.date | dotDate }}</span>
          <span class="topic-title">{{ a.data.journal.title if a.data.journal else a.data.science.title }}</span>
          <span class="topic-excerpt">{{ a.data.journal.excerpt if a.data.journal else a.data.science.text }}</span>
          <span class="topic-time">{{ a.data.readMinutes }} min read</span>
        </a>
        {%- else %}
        <p>Translations coming soon.</p>
        {%- endfor %}
      </div>
    </section>
    {%- endfor %}
    {%- set others = [] %}
    {%- for a in collections.articlesEn %}{% if not a.data.topic %}{% set others = (others.push(a), others) %}{% endif %}{% endfor %}
    {%- if others.length %}
    <section id="more" aria-labelledby="topic-more">
      <h2 class="doc-title" id="topic-more">Books &amp; guides</h2>
      <div class="topic-list">
        {%- for a in others %}
        <a class="topic-item" data-rise href="{{ a.page.fileSlug }}.html">
          <span class="topic-date">{{ a.page.date | dotDate }}</span>
          <span class="topic-title">{{ a.data.guide.title if a.data.guide else a.data.headline }}</span>
          <span class="topic-excerpt">{{ a.data.guide.text if a.data.guide else a.data.description }}</span>
          <span class="topic-time">{{ a.data.readMinutes }} min read</span>
        </a>
        {%- endfor %}
      </div>
    </section>
    {%- endif %}
  </section>
</main>
<footer class="mini-footer" data-nav="light" data-nav-solid="light">
  {% include "partials/footer-map.njk" %}
  {% include "partials/footer-links-en.njk" %}
  <p class="mini-footer-copy">© 2026 MOUTON — PERSONAL ARCHIVE</p>
</footer>
